\par \pard\plain \s2\rtlch\af9\afs32\ab \ltrch\hich\af3\loch\ilvl1\outlinelevel1\sl384\slmult1\sb375\sa150\keepn\cf19\f3\fs32\b\dbch\af8\ql\ltrpar{\loch
1. Summary}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\ltrpar{\loch
This report documents the events surrounding the admission and subsequent discharge of an anonymous patient, referenced throughout this draft as Patient X, at Northgate Regional Medical Center on 14 January 2024. The purpose of this document is to provide a factual timeline for the internal quality-review process and to support the preparation of summary materials for the patient-safety review meeting.}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\ltrpar{\loch
The incident falls under the category of "Delayed Diagnostic Evaluation" and is being reviewed in accordance with the hospital's standard operating procedures for cardiac emergency cases. This draft consolidates data from electronic health records, nursing logs, and staff interviews to establish a clear sequence of events.}
\par \pard\plain \s2\rtlch\af9\afs32\ab \ltrch\hich\af3\loch\ilvl1\outlinelevel1\sl384\slmult1\sb375\sa150\keepn\cf19\f3\fs32\b\dbch\af8\ql\ltrpar{\loch
2. Timeline}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa120\ltrpar{\loch\b\loch
08:12}{\loch
 \u8212\'97 Patient X arrived at the emergency department with complaints of chest tightness and shortness of breath. Triage nurse recorded the initial symptoms and routed Patient X to the cardiac observation area.}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa120\ltrpar{\loch\b\loch
08:45}{\loch
 \u8212\'97 Vital signs were taken. Blood pressure 142/90, heart rate 96, oxygen saturation 94 percent on room air. Patient X was placed on continuous monitoring.}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa120\ltrpar{\loch\b\loch
09:20}{\loch
 \u8212\'97 Laboratory results were reviewed. The attending physician noted that Patient X required further evaluation and ordered additional imaging studies.}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa120\ltrpar{\loch\b\loch
10:05}{\loch
 \u8212\'97 Imaging results were discussed in the morning huddle. The care team agreed to keep Patient X under observation and to repeat laboratory tests in four hours.}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa120\ltrpar{\loch\b\loch
11:30}{\loch
 \u8212\'97 Patient X reported increased discomfort. The on-call team was notified and a bedside assessment was performed. Medication adjustments were made and the patient was re-evaluated within one hour.}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa120\ltrpar{\loch\b\loch
12:15}{\loch
 \u8212\'97 The family of Patient X was contacted and informed of the current status. Questions were answered by the assigned nurse, and the family requested to be updated at each shift change.}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa120\ltrpar{\loch\b\loch
13:40}{\loch
 \u8212\'97 Patient X's condition stabilized. The care team documented the response to treatment and updated the care plan accordingly.}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa120\ltrpar{\loch\b\loch
15:20}{\loch
 \u8212\'97 A secondary review of the medication chart was completed. No additional concerns were identified at this time.}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa120\ltrpar{\loch\b\loch
16:00}{\loch
 \u8212\'97 Patient X was transferred to the observation unit. The handoff included a summary of symptoms, interventions, and monitoring requirements.}
\par \pard\plain \s2\rtlch\af9\afs32\ab \ltrch\hich\af3\loch\ilvl1\outlinelevel1\sl384\slmult1\sb375\sa150\keepn\cf19\f3\fs32\b\dbch\af8\ql\ltrpar{\loch
3. Observations and Contributing Factors}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\ltrpar{\loch
The review of available records indicates that Patient X experienced a delay between the initial complaint and the completion of imaging studies. The contributing factors under consideration include staffing levels in the emergency department, equipment availability, and the workflow used for prioritizing cardiac patients during the morning surge.}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\ltrpar{\loch
Specifically, the interval between the order for imaging (09:20) and the completion of the study (10:05) exceeds the departmental benchmark of 30 minutes for non-emergent cardiac cases. Preliminary data suggests that a high volume of triage arrivals between 08:00 and 09:00 contributed to the queue for imaging services.}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\ltrpar{\loch
This section is intended to remain factual and neutral. It is not a determination of fault. It is provided so that the review board can consider the operational context when preparing its summary recommendations.}
\par \pard\plain \s2\rtlch\af9\afs32\ab \ltrch\hich\af3\loch\ilvl1\outlinelevel1\sl384\slmult1\sb375\sa150\keepn\cf19\f3\fs32\b\dbch\af8\ql\ltrpar{\loch
4. Interventions}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5\ql\ltrpar{\loch
The following interventions were documented in connection with Patient X's care:}
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af4 \ltrch\hich\af4\loch\f4\dbch\af4 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls1 \fi-283\li0\lin0\ql\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
Continuous cardiac monitoring from 08:45 to 16:00. }
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af4 \ltrch\hich\af4\loch\f4\dbch\af4 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls1 \fi-283\li0\lin0\ql\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
Two sets of laboratory tests, completed at 09:20 and 13:10. }
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af4 \ltrch\hich\af4\loch\f4\dbch\af4 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls1 \fi-283\li0\lin0\ql\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
One imaging study, completed at 10:05. }
\par \pard\plain \s30\rtlch\af5\afs24 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\sl384\slmult1\sb0\sa283\cf21\f5\fs24\dbch\af5{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af4 \ltrch\hich\af4\loch\f4\dbch\af4 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls1 \fi-283\li0\lin0\ql\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
Medication adjustments at 11:45 and 13:05. }
